    <string name="onb_sim_title">Which SIM receives your payments?</string>
    <string name="onb_sim_body">Choose the SIM your till confirmations arrive on. Messages on your other SIM are ignored completely.</string>

    <string name="onb_gateway_title">Connect your SCOPE SMS account</string>
    <string name="onb_gateway_body">Replies are sent through the SCOPE gateway using your registered sender ID, so they come from your business name. This needs internet — a payment that arrives offline is queued and sent when you are back online.</string>

    <string name="onb_battery_title">Keep Scope SMS running</string>
    <string name="onb_battery_body">Phones close apps in the background to save battery. If that happens to Scope SMS, payments are missed while your screen is off.</string>
